        [('$105', 'Drops a zero'), ('$2,142.86', 'Divides by 0.70'), ('$1,500', 'Uses $1 a mile')],
        intro='Instead of tracking every car cost, many self-employed people deduct business miles at the IRS standard rate, which changes each year. A mileage log is needed.',
